⸻

Troubleshooting

Missing Python dependencies

pip install -r requirements.txt

⸻

Docker command not found

Ensure Docker is installed and running:

docker --version

⸻

FPGA runtime issues

Verify:

* Vitis AI runtime installation
* FPGA board compatibility
* DPU overlay configuration

⸻

Slow inference on CPU

CPU execution is intended primarily for validation and benchmarking. Real-time performance is achieved through FPGA DPU acceleration.

